{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a small, eerie apartment, trapped in a looping night from 10 PM to 6 AM. Strange things begin to happen\u2014and they change every time you make a different choice. A mysterious cat appears at midnight. Feed it, and reality unravels...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705330/extras/a0d6729edae38dc52e958cab9302f9a7.poster.avif?t=1757860681\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705330/extras/a0d6729edae38dc52e958cab9302f9a7.webm?t=1757860681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705330/extras/a0d6729edae38dc52e958cab9302f9a7.mp4?t=1757860681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd11 <strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f0 <strong>Relive the same night</strong> \u2014 over and over \u2014 from 10 PM to 6 AM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f <strong>Uncover hidden changes</strong> each time the clock resets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Things aren\u2019t where you left them</strong>... and something might be watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple first-person controls</strong> \u2014 dive in and explore without distractions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Eerie atmosphere</strong> built with dynamic lighting and unsettling visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Discover cryptic notes and clues</strong> that hint at a deeper truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Short, intense, replayable experience</strong> \u2014 every loop tells more of the story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag